      "label": "Continuous f and differentiable bounds: chain rule / f 连续、端点可导，再用链式法则"
    },
    {
      "id": "e11",
      "fromNode": "a015",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "a016",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Continuity makes a bounded integral average attainable / 连续性使界内的积分平均值被取到"
    },
    {
      "id": "e14",
      "fromNode": "a019",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "a018",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "Continuous f gives G′=f without an elementary formula / 连续 f 无须初等表达式也给出 G′=f"
    },
    {
      "id": "e15",
      "fromNode": "a020",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "a021",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Strip length becomes complete cross-sectional area / 条长推广为完整截面积"
    },
    {
      "id": "e16",
      "fromNode": "a021",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "a022",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "When perpendicular sections are actual disks or annuli / 垂直截面确为圆盘或圆环时"
    },
    {
      "id": "e17",
      "fromNode": "a021",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "a023",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Regroup a solid of revolution into radial layers / 将旋转体改按半径分层"
    },
    {
      "id": "e18",
      "fromNode": "a023",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "a024",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "At the same radius, use the union of axial segments / 同半径轴向区段取并集"
    },
    {
      "id": "e19",
      "fromNode": "a024",
      "fromSide": "top",
      "toNode": "a022",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "label": "Alternatively integrate the area of each actual section / 也可积分每个实际截面的面积"
    },
    {
      "id": "e20",
      "fromNode": "a023",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "a030",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "For a one-sided bounded region of positive area, radial area moment = area × area-centroid axis distance / 单侧有界正面积区域：径向面积矩 = 面积 × 面积形心轴距"
    },
    {
      "id": "e21",
      "fromNode": "a025",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "a026",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Unit weights are the uniform-average case / 单位权重对应均匀区间平均"
    },
    {
      "id": "e22",
      "fromNode": "a026",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "a027",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Position weighted by mass, with finite positive total and finite absolute first moments / 以质量平均位置，须总质量有限且正、绝对一阶矩有限"
    },
    {
      "id": "e23",
      "fromNode": "a027",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "a028",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Integrate the same piece masses and signed coordinate moments / 对同一微元累加质量与带符号坐标矩"
    },
    {
      "id": "e24",
      "fromNode": "arc-reuse",
      "fromSide": "top",
      "toNode": "a025",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "label": "For positive finite length L, average with ds/L / 曲线长度 L 有限且正时按 ds/L 平均"
    },
    {
      "id": "e25",
      "fromNode": "a031",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "a033",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Same grid: T = (L + R)/2 / 同一网格：左右和取平均"
    },
    {
      "id": "e26",
      "fromNode": "a033",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "a036",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Add C² and a whole-interval second-derivative bound / 补全段二阶导数界与 C²"
    },
    {
      "id": "e27",
      "fromNode": "a032",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "a035",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Same coarse grid: midpoint weight 2/3 / 同一粗网格：中点权重 2/3"
    },
    {
      "id": "e28",
      "fromNode": "a033",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "a035",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Same coarse grid: trapezoidal weight 1/3 / 同一粗网格：梯形权重 1/3"
    },
    {
      "id": "e29",
      "fromNode": "a035",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "a034",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "n coarse pieces → 2n fine pieces / n 段粗网格 → 2n 段细网格"
    },
    {
      "id": "e30",
      "fromNode": "a037",
      "fromSide": "top",
      "toNode": "a036",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "toEnd": "none",
      "label": "Same interval, N, K₂: midpoint bound = ½ trapezoidal bound / 同区间、N、K₂：中点界为梯形界一半"
    },
    {
      "id": "e31",
      "fromNode": "a034",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "a038",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Add C⁴ and a whole-interval fourth-derivative bound / 补全段四阶导数界与 C⁴"
    },
    {
      "id": "e32",
      "fromNode": "a010",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "a039",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Use evenness at finite cutoffs, then check both tails / 先在有限截断用偶性，再核两侧尾积分"
    },
    {
      "id": "e33",
      "fromNode": "improper",
      "fromSide": "top",
      "toNode": "a039",
